                    A wealth management firm is hiring a full-time short-form video editor for ongoing work. NDA required before any source material is shared.



/// The Opportunity

This starts as short-form editing and grows from there. The channel is scaling and we're investing in it. The right person takes on more of the pipeline over time, with pay that grows alongside.



/// Pay

$800/month to start, full-time.



/// Trial First

$20 paid trial clip from a 5-minute source. 48-hour turnaround. Top performers move forward to the full-time slot.



/// The Work

Convert long-form YouTube videos (max 30 min each) into vertical shorts for Instagram, TikTok, LinkedIn, YouTube Shorts, and X. Typical batch is 10 sources producing 20–30 shorts. 1-week max turnaround per batch. Volume varies month to month.



/// The Skill That Matters

We are not hiring a cropper. You need to rearrange animated graphics from source files, reposition speakers and raw footage, spot quotable 
nts in talking-head content, and make each clip look like it was shot for vertical



/// Per Clip

Hook in first 3 seconds. Cut from source. Reframe to 9:16. Apply brand kit (provided). Open captions, exact transcription. End card with required disclosure (provided).



/// Requirements

Premiere + After Effects (rearranging graphics requires it)

Vertical short-form portfolio

Full-time availability

Willing to sign NDA



/// To Apply

Send your single favorite vertical short you've edited

One sentence on why this role is right for you

Confirm you will sign NDA and complete the $20 paid trial
